    <!-- ONE FRAME LATE - Technical Reality Spike 01 + THE LAST PERFORMANCE Stage V1
         SYNC -> DELAY -> SHADOW_HOLD -> RESET, driven by view model + state machine only.
         Click the puppet to toggle its arm. Click the square button to RESET.
         Progression memory = ViewModel.moves (valid puppet pose changes):
           moves 1    : SYNC         (shadow transitions fire on the same property, same blend)
           moves 2-3  : DELAY        (shadow waits 500ms in a hold state, then performs the same pose)
           moves >= 4 : SHADOW_HOLD + autonomous puppet reversal  (puppet lowers; shadow stays UP for 2s before following)
         Not authored art. Crude primitives by design. -->
